"A demon can slip into the Ocean of Souls unseen by the Guardians, swallow a soul rising to rebirth, and ride it into an unborn body."
"The light at the surface of the Ocean of Souls burns a demon far worse than it burns a soul, and leaves it weak on the far side."
"A demon cult's summoning aims to put a demon into an unborn child, so that the child is born already possessed."
"Demons ride rats, crows and other small creatures as spies, and those creatures grow talons and claws that are not their own."
"A soul that devours a demon keeps the shredded demon inside it, and gains its Shadow affinity and a Path of Soulstealing."
"Only the Holy affinity can find a demon that is hiding inside a person."
"Demons seek something they call the Worldsoul, and a falling comet is one of their failures."
